- [ ] `DjangoImportedStationRepository.__init__(self, source: str = XMLFeedSource.STRATUS)` stores `self._source`. Each method filters or creates with `source=self._source`: `find_by_source_id`, `create_or_update` (in the `update_or_create` lookup kwargs), `mark_automation`, `get_or_create_stub`, `delete_by_source_id` and `find_stale_automation_stations`. Method signatures and the `ImportedStationRepository` Protocol are unchanged.
